OL,3,GNEWSACouncil explores possible seaside
OL,4,Atown tram network
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is exploring the possibility
OL,7,Fof introducing trams as part of a
OL,8,Flong-term plan to reduce reliance on
OL,9,Fcars and buses.
OL,11,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,12,F(BCP) Council is looking at a potential
OL,13,Ftram or ultra-light rail network
OL,14,Flinking major destinations across the
OL,15,Farea as part of a 15-year transport
OL,16,Fstrategy, with a goal of delivering
OL,17,Fmass transit by 2041.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
