OL,3,GNEWSACouncil explores possible seaside
OL,4,Atown tram network
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Andy Hadley said no
OL,7,Fcommitments had been made as the plans
OL,8,Frequire capital investment but said it
OL,9,Fwas "certainly something we have the
OL,10,Fambition and hope to see happen one
OL,11,Fday".
OL,13,FHe suggested a route linking
OL,14,FBournemouth town centre, the football
OL,15,Fstadium, hospital, Castlepoint shopping
OL,16,Fcentre and the airport.
